notes: "One source, many talks. Main Slides is the canonical deck. A Presentation is a selection and order of those pages, with notes for that room. The Short introduction in this project is a real six-page Presentation built from Main. I can give a short version and a long version without maintaining two decks. If a page is fixed, every talk that uses it moves forward. If a talk has to stay exactly as it was, I can pin a version."
